      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "セオドラ様、本当にありがとうございます！\nこれで緊急時でも食料の備えは万全です。\nサラミス近海の安全を守れるように兵士達と協力して\n今後は海獣対策を強化していくつもりです！",
        "official_en": "A thousand thanks, Queen Theodora! Our supply of\nfood should now see us through any emergency that\nmay crop up. We'll work with the soldiers to thin the\nranks of sea beasts and keep Saramis's waters safe!",
        "real_en": null
      },
